#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:5 76b03b69ec544e7eab63a2ef5b47b101
msgid "Arming the motors"
msgstr "解锁电机"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:7 14e9e9e95b7849d98cd51265e745fe5c
msgid ""
"Arming the vehicle allows the motors to start spinning.  Before arming, make"
" sure all people, objects, and any body parts (e.g., hands) are clear of the"
" propellers. Then do the following:"
msgstr "解锁飞行器可使电机开始旋转。解锁前，请确保所有人员、物品和身体部位（如手）远离螺旋桨。然后执行以下操作："

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:12 0a636fb890d240afabcc61f41d3211f5
msgid "Turn on your transmitter."
msgstr "打开遥控器。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:13 41ae001a9a664169bc2c4e3585938ba9
msgid ""
"Plug in the LiPo battery.  The red and blue lights should flash for a few "
"seconds as the gyros are calibrated (do not move the copter)"
msgstr "插上LiPo电池。红灯和蓝灯应闪烁几秒以完成陀螺仪校准（此时请勿移动飞行器）。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:14 1bfff2adae494062bd59884470974670
msgid ""
"The pre-arm checks will run automatically and if any problems are found the "
"RGB LED will blink yellow and the failure will be displayed on the ground "
"station.  Please refer to :ref:`this page <common-prearm-safety-checks>`"
msgstr ""
"解锁前检查将自动运行，如果发现任何问题，RGB LED将闪烁黄色，故障信息将显示在地面站上。请参考 :ref:`此页面 <common-prearm-"
"safety-checks>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:15
#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:55 62ed193ba18942b4a3ead06fb80c5dc5
#: a3e708af25ea409cbec5040f6f4f7d18
msgid ""
"Check that your flight mode switch is set to Stabilize, ACRO, AltHold, "
"Loiter, or PosHold"
msgstr "检查飞行模式开关是否设置为Stabilize、Acro、AltHold、Loiter或PosHold。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:16 06f40a1750e1475aab125385ad0c1cac
msgid ""
"If using an autopilot with a safety switch, press it until the light goes "
"solid"
msgstr "如果使用带安全开关的飞控，按压安全开关直到指示灯变为常亮。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:17 e520eb1785d047f2830f99fe17dedc76
msgid ""
"If you are planning on using an autonomous mode (i.e. Loiter, RTL, Auto, "
"etc) switch the vehicle to Loiter or PosHold and wait until the LEDs blink "
"green indicating a good GPS lock"
msgstr ""
"如果您计划使用自主模式（如Loiter、RTL、Auto等），将飞行器切换到Loiter或PosHold并等待LED闪绿灯，表示GPS锁定良好。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:18 50518288ad88480eb49ca3cd2d0930c1
msgid ""
"Arm the motors by holding the throttle down, and rudder right for 5 seconds."
"  Do not hold the rudder right for too long (>15 seconds) or you will begin "
"the :ref:`AutoTrim <autotrim>` feature"
msgstr ""
"通过将油门摇杆向下、方向舵向右保持5秒来解锁电机。不要将方向舵向右保持太长时间（>15秒），否则将启动 :ref:`AutoTrim "
"<autotrim>` 功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:19 735f95d109eb4117a4e63911b35762d3
msgid ""
"Once armed, the LEDs will go solid and the propellers will begin to spin"
msgstr "解锁后，LED将变为常亮，螺旋桨将开始旋转。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:20 809cca1b71d146968d8cd1feed832b39
msgid "Raise the throttle to take-off"
msgstr "推高油门起飞。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:24 01c12fd4c6f14e0a8eaa3fa081e9cb3e
msgid ""
"If you leave the throttle at minimum for 15 seconds while in any of the "
"above modes the motors will automatically disarm."
msgstr "如果在上述任何模式下将油门保持在最低位置15秒，电机将自动上锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:27 938124897b37422d89326dc7927dad23
msgid "you cannot arm while in certain modes. See the table below:"
msgstr "在某些模式下无法解锁。请参见下表："

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:30 c3b917de4ba44ca38ddc22dfab231bb5
msgid "Modes not allowing Arming"
msgstr "不允许解锁的模式"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:30 0e33d5d55914489b9cde9d80ed024605
msgid "Exceptions"
msgstr "例外情况"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:32 25a8ec5eb5574a9280dae492ec155061
msgid "AUTO"
msgstr "AUTO"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:32 ee366a545eee441d890d98714a94299d
msgid ":ref:`AUTO_OPTIONS<AUTO_OPTIONS>` bit 0 is set (Allow arming in mode)"
msgstr ":ref:`AUTO_OPTIONS<AUTO_OPTIONS>` 第0位已设置（允许在该模式下解锁）"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:33
#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:44 69c807c5b0a44215a09ab9b938efe080
#: 84dddff27cbe42ec8f43d880449dd192
msgid "AUTOTUNE"
msgstr "AUTOTUNE"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:34 e0f60c6018ea40b68a307abd7fcb2647
msgid "BRAKE"
msgstr "BRAKE"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:35 8ff3873bf8c34b9d9aa9f9440cea1abe
msgid "CIRCLE"
msgstr "CIRCLE"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:36 a42c9722731e4dbfa754e84587ffb401
msgid "FLIP"
msgstr "Flip"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:37 7eca1ef205bf4c9088c1ba6c77fc02cf
msgid "GUIDED"
msgstr "Guided"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:37 dc14222e097b44afb5d570333dc474a2
msgid ""
"via MAVLink DO_ARM/DISARM command, :ref:`common-lua-scripts`, or "
":ref:`common-auxiliary-functions<common-auxiliary-functions>` switch if "
"enabled with :ref:`GUID_OPTIONS<GUID_OPTIONS>`"
msgstr ""
"通过MAVLink DO_ARM/DISARM命令、:ref:`common-lua-scripts` 或 :ref:`common-"
"auxiliary-functions<common-auxiliary-functions>` 开关（如果使用 "
":ref:`GUID_OPTIONS<GUID_OPTIONS>` 启用）"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:38 38390fa761e24c6b93931562fd751ab8
msgid "LAND"
msgstr "Land"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:39 9b79b9c3889249f2a58074f31b241dab
msgid "RTL"
msgstr "RTL"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:40 4b9e83fc27ee4e11965c74a95dcb4453
msgid "SMARTRTL"
msgstr "SMARTRTL"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:41 0a659fa2715f45fe970e77b8b4eeacac
msgid "SYSID"
msgstr "SysID"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:42 26cb2e61a3b546939d8742a5316c5fbe
msgid "AVOIDADSB"
msgstr "AVOIDADSB"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:43 38e3117c27534fa1a26b15ede4e291ff
msgid "FOLLOW"
msgstr "Follow"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:48 54616024017547a38a77e2d3b0a5a706
msgid ""
"If setup, you can use one of the **RC_xOPTION switches** that includes the "
"arm function. See switch option \"153\", \"154, or \"160\"."
msgstr "如果已设置，可以使用包含解锁功能的 **RC_xOPTION开关** 之一。参见开关选项\"153\"、\"154\"或\"160\"。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:51 8f6f4ad40c0d4db0bdc9d2ccdb7cf1c5
msgid "Disarming the motors"
msgstr "上锁电机"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:53 752af8fd402a463cabd5f7c34d4e596d
msgid ""
"Disarming the motors will cause the motors to stop spinning. To disarm the "
"motors do the following:"
msgstr "上锁电机将使电机停止旋转。要上锁电机，请执行以下操作："

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:56 f7f5bf3031a74f03bb57fcb634f3d4e5
msgid "Hold throttle at minimum and rudder to the left for 2 seconds"
msgstr "将油门保持在最低，方向舵向左保持2秒。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:57 e45f3dd4e60a44689696fea17f5ce34c
msgid "The LED will start flashing indicating the vehicle is disarmed"
msgstr "LED将开始闪烁，表示飞行器已上锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:58 cf10f1d9c3fc41309af8e1333e42b778
msgid ""
"If using an autopilot with a safety switch, press it until the LED begins "
"flashing"
msgstr "如果使用带安全开关的飞控，按压安全开关直到LED开始闪烁。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:59 730e3349326c439297fc0fb1a81a81a6
msgid "Disconnect the Lipo battery."
msgstr "断开LiPo电池。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:60 18775da3e23d4994944c919d55525d07
msgid "Turn off your transmitter."
msgstr "关闭遥控器。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:62 af15eb3077ae415ab77d91225b5a5f42
msgid ""
"If setup, you can use one of the ``RC_xOPTION`` switches that includes the "
"disarm function. See switch option \"81\", \"153, or \"154\"."
msgstr "如果已设置，可以使用包含上锁功能的 ``RC_xOPTION`` 开关之一。参见开关选项\"81\"、\"153\"或\"154\"。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:65 bdf9d4c05f5748dda4e3579a54ce682d
msgid "GCS Status Messages"
msgstr "地面站状态消息"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:67 87b152f34cdb4ef8a2a1191f8cb9f9fc
msgid ""
"Unless the :ref:`ARMING_OPTIONS<ARMING_OPTIONS>` bit 2 is set, text messages"
" will be sent to the GCS to indicate when arming or disarming has occurred."
msgstr ""
"除非设置了 :ref:`ARMING_OPTIONS<ARMING_OPTIONS>` 第2位，否则将向地面站发送文字消息，指示解锁或上锁已发生。"
